IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `haa-guarantee`

-- Housing Australia Act 2018 (Cth) -- worked cases, from the seat of the first home buyer.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or Housing Australia's guidance. The Investment Mandate, which sets the Home Guarantee Scheme's
-- criteria and deposit, is not deposited: its figures are inputs.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_housing-australia-act-2018_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.

`Chloe and Liam's Byford loan` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`a loan where I miss the Mandate's criteria` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS FALSE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`a loan over the Mandate's limits` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS FALSE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`a loan where the lender has not applied` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS FALSE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`a loan from a lender that is not a constitutional corporation` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `another entity`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`a loan with no written agreement` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS TRUE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS FALSE

`a loan the Mandate does not provide for` MEANS `Home loan` WITH
    `my lender` IS `a constitutional corporation`
    `the Investment Mandate provides that Housing Australia must consider such an application` IS FALSE
    `my lender applied to Housing Australia for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is for the purpose of improving housing outcomes` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee assists my lender in its business` IS TRUE
    `I meet the Investment Mandate's criteria for the guarantee` IS TRUE
    `the guarantee is within the Investment Mandate's limits` IS TRUE
    `the terms are set out in a written agreement between Housing Australia and my lender` IS TRUE

`Chloe, a first home buyer` MEANS Buyer WITH
    `am a first home buyer` IS TRUE
    `am a single parent with dependants` IS FALSE
    `am a single legal guardian of a child` IS FALSE
    `have held an ownership interest in real property in Australia in the last 10 years` IS FALSE

`a buyer who sold a home 3 years ago` MEANS Buyer WITH
    `am a first home buyer` IS FALSE
    `am a single parent with dependants` IS FALSE
    `am a single legal guardian of a child` IS FALSE
    `have held an ownership interest in real property in Australia in the last 10 years` IS TRUE

§ `s 8(1B) -- to whom a guarantee can be issued (c051: the guarantee goes to the lender, not to Chloe)`

#ASSERT `Can Housing Australia issue a guarantee to this party` `a constitutional corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can Housing Australia issue a guarantee to this party` `an individual` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can Housing Australia issue a guarantee to this party` `a State or Territory` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can Housing Australia issue a guarantee to this party` `a constitutional corporation` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can Housing Australia issue a guarantee to this party` `a constitutional corporation` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `Can I be issued a guarantee myself` `an individual` TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I be issued a guarantee myself` `a constitutional corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can I be issued a guarantee myself` `a constitutional corporation` FALSE

§ `ss 10, 12, 13 -- the guarantee behind my loan (c051)`

#ASSERT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `Chloe and Liam's Byford loan`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan where I miss the Mandate's criteria`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan over the Mandate's limits`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan where the lender has not applied`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan from a lender that is not a constitutional corporation`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan with no written agreement`
#ASSERT NOT `Is a guarantee on my loan within what the Act allows` `a loan the Mandate does not provide for`

#ASSERT `Is my loan guaranteed by Housing Australia` `Chloe and Liam's Byford loan` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my loan guaranteed by Housing Australia` `Chloe and Liam's Byford loan` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is my loan guaranteed by Housing Australia` `a loan where I miss the Mandate's criteria` TRUE

#ASSERT `What does the Act say about my deposit` EQUALS "nothing: the Act sets no deposit; any minimum is a criterion or limit in the Investment Mandate (ss 12, 13(b)(iia), (c)(ii))"

#ASSERT `How much deposit do I need` 620000 5 EQUALS 31000

#ASSERT `Does my deposit meet the minimum` 620000 31000 5
#ASSERT NOT `Does my deposit meet the minimum` 620000 30999 5

§ `s 10(5)-(7) -- what the guarantee agreement asks of me (c051)`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I a party to the guarantee agreement` `an individual` TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I a party to the guarantee agreement` `a constitutional corporation` TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Must I comply with the guarantee terms` `an individual` TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Can Housing Australia recover a debt from me under the agreement` `an individual` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `Can Housing Australia recover a debt from me under the agreement` `a constitutional corporation` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 48A, 51 -- Commonwealth backing (c051: contract of 20 February 2028)`

#ASSERT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20280220 0 FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20280220 20290101 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20290201 20290101 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20290101 20290101 FALSE
#ASSERT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20280220 20280101 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Is the guarantee backed by the Commonwealth` 20280220 0 TRUE

#ASSERT `Can Commonwealth money meet the guarantee` `Chloe and Liam's Byford loan` TRUE

§ `ss 3, 14 -- the Minister, the object, and rights`

#ASSERT NOT `Can the Minister direct a guarantee for my loan` 

#ASSERT `Am I one of the buyers the Act is for` `Chloe, a first home buyer`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I one of the buyers the Act is for` `a buyer who sold a home 3 years ago`

#ASSERT NOT `Does the Act give me a right to a guarantee` 

